# Default setup for dimension questions

When the user asks about dimensions, geometry, clearances, orifices, gaps, flow, mass, or anything “on the model” / CAD / physics:

- **Default setup**: the saved reactor in `save/setups.json` named **`Small prototype`** (also referred to as “small reactor” / “small prototype”).
- Load that entry and answer from those parameters unless they name another save or give explicit overrides.
- Do not silently use in-code defaults (`SMALL_DISK`, UI draft state, or another preset) when a save-based answer is intended.
- If the save is missing or renamed, say so and ask which setup to use — do not invent parameters.
